    love:
      "Two Geminis in love can talk until sunrise and still have a dozen topics left. You understand each other's need for variety, freedom and play, and you never mistake restlessness for a lack of affection. Flirting is a sport here, and you both win.\n\nRomance is light, clever and full of surprise — a new bar, a new book, a new inside joke every week. The love deepens when you dare to put down the clever lines and say something simple and true. Then this bond becomes both fun and genuinely intimate.",
